      "en": "The angel who talked with me came again and wakened me, as a man who is wakened out of his sleep.",
      "ko": "내게 말하던 천사가 다시 와서 나를 깨우니 마치 자는 사람이 깨우임 같더라",
      "source_text_hash": "600459a2ee9ba6d70c03e14cdc7f7a53fa542c35ff9209bca1bf83aa1bb01775",
      "translation_text_hash": "dd895d3ff38a84e559b4e68b5e8e95704fc058e4fa61cf34e19f73f91441ddb8",
